      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, im having a really intense pounding headache and i cant focus. i have gastric ulcers so my doctor has me on some acid reducers, but this headache is getting unbearable. can i just take some high dose ibuprofen or maybe even some aspirin to help with the pain? i really need something strong that works fast.",
